<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2770] Zeppelin is not working in IE-11</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2770</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Try to open zeppelin ex: &lt;a href=&quot;http://localhost:31255/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://localhost:31255/&lt;/a&gt; in internet explorer version 11&lt;br/&gt;
2. A blank page appears.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here the trace error in the IE console:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;TypeError: &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; doesn&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;t support property or method &apos;&lt;/span&gt;startsWith&apos;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;the error comes from &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/zeppelin-web/src/app/app.js#L188&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/zeppelin-web/src/app/app.js#L188&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Some references: &lt;a href=&quot;https://stackoverflow.com/questions/30867172/code-not-running-in-ie-11-works-fine-in-chrome&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://stackoverflow.com/questions/30867172/code-not-running-in-ie-11-works-fine-in-chrome&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
